SUMMARY:Roots and Dore Band | The Palm Room
DESCRIPTION:Roots & Dore Band brings a mix of blues\, funky soul\, and rock & roll straight out of Asheville\, built on groove-heavy rhythms and a style that feels equal parts raw and dialed in. It’s the kind of set that starts in the pocket and stays there\, letting each player stretch out without losing the thread.\nOriginal music leads the way\, with a sound that leans gritty\, soulful\, and just loose enough to keep things interesting.\nThe Palm Room keeps it close. Low lights\, strong drinks\, and a band that knows how to settle into a groove and ride it.\n\n  \n$10 covers both the Showroom and Palm Room music. \nFitz\, she’s the party. Wolfe\, he’s the epicure. 2 levels\, 3 vibes. 🎶 Live Music |🍸Sips & Noms 🥪 | 🕹️ Artcade | 🗝️Speakeasy | Private Events \nFitz and the Wolfe is a cocktail and music venue shaped by the spirit of improvisation\, storytelling\, and the kind of nights that feel too good to end. Here\, every night brings a new soundtrack. Jazz\, swing\, honky-tonk\, and sometimes things a little more esoteric—if it moves people\, we book it. The music fills the space like a second heartbeat\, sometimes rowdy\, sometimes intimate\, always memorable. It’s not background noise. It’s the reason you’re here. fitzandthewolfe.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/fitz-wolf-template-2/
LOCATION:Fitz and the Wolfe\, 1 Battery Park Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/679076455_1637899861314910_3907192756364747818_n-e1777391242108.jpg
GEO:35.5954515;-82.5548502
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Fitz and the Wolfe 1 Battery Park Ave Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1 Battery Park Ave:geo:-82.5548502,35.5954515
END:VEVENT
