SUMMARY:The Wild Card feat Lenny Pettinelli\, Nik Hope & Preston Cate
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special night featuring some of Asheville’s finest players! The trio will be led by the Empire Strikes Brass keyboardist and singer Lenny Pettinelli with fellow ESB bandmate Nik Hope on drums plus local great Preston Cate on guitar. \nShiloh & Gaines – Your neighborhood bar……no matter where you live. \nCoffee ~ Spirits ~ Pool ~ Darts ~ Live Music ~ Dog Friendly ~ Karaoke & More! Find our music schedule and more at shilohandgaines.com
