SUMMARY:Strong Fire
DESCRIPTION:Strong Fire is back at One World Brewing West Asheville on Friday\, May 22nd!!\n\nStrong Fire brings the tight soulful sounds of Jamaica from the 60’s and early 70’s featuring:Jonathan Lloyd on Vocals/TromboneJon Lauterer on Drums/VocalsBuffalo Brown on Guitar/VocalsAndre Lyles on BassCharlie Evans on KeysBen Colvin on Sax\nMusic starts at 9pm.\n$10 at the door\n\n\nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/strong-fire-3/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/686088976_1560140089454201_7794468906879968151_n-e1779392088240.jpg
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
