SUMMARY:Soul Nite with Bobby Bluu & BRB
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a night of real Southern Soul!!!\n\n\n\n10pm | $10 \nThe Double Crown – Great vibes\, great bourbon\, and great music! (21+ only\, dog friendly) A West Asheville institution\, the Double Crown hosts Western Wednesdays\, karaoke\, DJ’s and rousing Gospel & Soul night’s each month. It’s a great place for an intimate evening of dancing\, drinks and fun\, especially if you love a good dive bar.
