SUMMARY:Live Music w/ Ryan Taylor Price\, Mouth Council\, Mike Holstein\, and Jason Merritt | Joran Slane’s 50th Birthday!
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the 50th birthday of Joran Slane Oppelt. The event is free\, all ages\, and open to the public. There will be food trucks and birthday cake. Live music by Ryan Taylor Price\, Mouth Council\, Mike Holstein\, and Jason Merritt. \n\n\n‘The Mule’ – Tasting Room \n\n\n\n\n\nSay hello to The Mule – a full-service bar/event space in the home of Devil’s Foot Beverage’s production facility. Draft soda\, beer\, & wine – as well as delicious cocktails & mocktails featuring Devil’s Foot craft sodas and the largest collection of NC-made spirits in Asheville – all at your fingertips just outside of Biltmore Village! Open now for all of your beverage & party needs! devilsfootbrew.com/the-mule
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/live-music-w-ryan-taylor-price-mouth-council-mike-holstein-and-jason-merritt-joran-slanes-50th-birthday/
LOCATION:The Mule at Devils Foot Beverages\, 131 Sweeten Creek Road\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
